        {
          "text": "Ngalokho usho kanje uJehova, uthi: “Aningilalelanga ngokumemezela inkululeko, kube yilowo nalowo kumfowabo, kube yilowo nalowo kumakhelwane wakhe; bhekani, ngiyakunibikela inkululeko, usho uJehova, enkembeni, nesifo, nasendlaleni; ngiyakukuphakamisa emibusweni yonke yomhlaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
